]Have fun reading it,[ Ire]ne[!!]
So, E-mile, the book comes back to you in[ Holland] and thanks again[!]
[Fran] is back[!!!!] My[ friend] from Switserland send me the[ book] back; so now I can read it myself. She realy liked it, so[ I]'m even more[ eager] to read it than[ I] already was[!!!
I] just[ loved] the[ book!!!!!
Fran] tells her story with such humor.[
]good reading material it is.[
